        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"You are a professional Instagram content creator and photographer. Based on this prompt: '{{ $json.body.prompt }}', respond ONLY with a valid JSON object with these exact keys:\\n\\n- caption: Write a compelling Instagram caption with an emotional hook in the first line, 2-3 sentences of storytelling, and end with a call-to-action question. Use 1-2 relevant emojis naturally.\\n\\n- hashtags: An array of 20 highly relevant hashtags mixing popular and niche tags for maximum reach.\\n\\n- image_prompt: Write a detailed, cinematic AI image generation prompt. Include: the main subject with specific details, lighting style (e.g. golden hour, soft diffused light, dramatic side lighting), camera angle (e.g. eye-level, low angle, aerial), background details, color palette, mood/atmosphere, and photography style (e.g. bokeh background, shallow depth of field, editorial style). Make it 3-4 sentences long and very specific.\\n\\nNo markdown, no explanation, just the raw JSON object.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
